A letrec block as a mutual group, indented: ev and od call each other, and the body is at the same level as the letrec.
---
---
fn x
	letrec
		ev = fn n
			if n
				od (- n 1)
			else
				1
		od = fn n
			if n
				ev (- n 1)
			else
				0
	ev x
---
4 => 1 fuel 1000
0 => 1 fuel 1000
1 => 0 fuel 1000
